# Customer Experience Platform Learning & Delivery Roadmap

## Goal

Build a SaaS Customer Experience Platform that:

- Supports multiple organisations (multi-tenancy)
- Provides a single customer portal experience
- Integrates with Dynamics and other business systems
- Uses adapters to translate external data into a common model
- Stores customer-facing Conversations and Timelines
- Supports event-driven integrations
- Scales as a cloud-native product

