# Phase 4: Messaging and Queues

## Objective

Understand reliable asynchronous processing.

---

## Core Concepts

### Queue

```text
Producer
 ↓
Queue
 ↓
Consumer
```

---

### Retry

Failed messages retry automatically.

- [ ] Understand Retry Policies

---

### Dead Letter Queue

Failed messages moved for investigation.

- [ ] Understand DLQs

---

### Idempotency

Same message processed multiple times safely.

Example:

```text
Repair Updated
```

received twice.

Result should remain:

```text
Repair Status = Complete
```

not duplicate data.

- [ ] Understand Idempotency

---

### Eventual Consistency

Data may not update instantly everywhere.

- [ ] Understand Eventual Consistency

